<title>POLAND: POLAND ALLOTS IMPEXMETAL SHARES AT PLN 36.</title>
<headline>POLAND ALLOTS IMPEXMETAL SHARES AT PLN 36.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish state treasury has alloted 2,994,142 shares of Polish metals trader Impexmetal SA at the minimum price of 36 zlotys, Impexmetal said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The statement said investors who bid above the 36 zloty limit, were alloted all ordered shares and those who ordered the shares at 36 zlotys had their orders reduced by about one percent.</p>
<p>The treasury ministry originally had 7,441,400 Impexmetal shares.</p>
<p>An earlier public offering of 3,189,171 new Impexmetal shares priced at 36 zlotys was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
